      "id": "2000007B",
      "title": "Power Generation",
      "subtitle": "Heat Generator — Your First FE Source",
      "description": [
        "FE (Forge Energy) is the universal power unit — 1 FE equals 1 RF equals 1 IF.",
        "Mekanism machines consume FE",
        "Heat Generators produce FE passively: surround with lava on all sides (passive mode) or insert burnable fuel (active mode)",
        "No moving parts, no maintenance",
        "Your first FE source."
