      "subtitle": "Metallurgic Infuser — Alloys and Circuits",
      "description": [
        "The Infuser combines a base material with an infuse type.",
        "Key recipes: Iron + Redstone = Enriched Alloy (infused with redstone)",
        "Iron + Coal/Charcoal = Steel (infused with carbon)",
        "Enriched Alloy + Redstone = Basic Control Circuit",
        "These two items — Enriched Alloy and Basic Control Circuit — are used in every Mekanism machine",
